{\large\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 關於本書}\qquad{\itshape\large\color{CoverGoldBright} About This Book}

\vspace{0.45cm}

\begin{minipage}{5in}
\small\color{CoverCream}
$if(backcover)$
$backcover$
$else$
本書依約翰福音研讀體例重編，分五卷逐章研讀希伯來書全書十三章：卷首三篇定位，十三章各設十六節——由〈基督焦點〉起，經原文研讀、歷代注疏、詩篇回應、聖詩默想、三大資源整合，到各章專設的〈鑰詞深讀〉與〈今天的祭壇〉，卷末以〈出到營外〉收束，書末附五種附錄。中文和合本與英文 NASB 十三章全文逐段對照。整合老弟兄查經教導、John MacArthur 逐節解經講道（gty.org）、G. Campbell Morgan《God's Last Word to Man》屬靈組織分析，貫穿全書「更美」（κρείττων）的論證骨架與五段嚴厲警告。

{\footnotesize\color{CoverCream} A chapter-by-chapter study of all thirteen chapters of Hebrews in five volumes, with the Chinese Union Version and the NASB set in parallel throughout, sixteen sections per chapter, and five appendices. It traces the book's \textit{better} (κρείττων) argument and its five solemn warnings — witnessing how Christ surpasses angels, Moses, Joshua and the Aaronic priesthood to become the mediator of a better covenant.}
$endif$
\end{minipage}

